WhatsApp Web Zaps

This extension contains code ported from Nostr WoT
(https://github.com/nostr-wot/nostr-wot-extension), licensed GPL-3.0-only:

- src/domain/lnurl.ts       from src/domain/wallet/lnurl.ts
- src/services/lnurl.ts     from src/services/wallet/lnurl.ts
- src/domain/bolt11.ts      amount rules from src/domain/wallet/bolt11.ts
- tests/lnurl.test.ts       from tests/wallet/lnurl.test.ts

- src/services/http.ts      from src/services/wallet/lnurl.ts (bounded JSON fetch)

Keep the LNURL safety checks in step with the upstream copies.

Where WhatsApp Web stores reactions (module WAWebAddonReactionTableMode,
function reactionTableMode.bulkUpsert, and the reaction fields) was taken from
whatsapp-web.js (https://github.com/pedroslopez/whatsapp-web.js, Apache-2.0),
which maintains these names against current WhatsApp Web.

The built extension bundles nostr-tools (Unlicense, public domain) and
@scure/base and @noble/* (MIT, Paul Miller).

